# 🔖 Dogear

**Your bookmarks, finally searchable.**\
Ask in natural language — Dogear finds what you saved.

100% local · No cloud · No API keys · Nothing leaves your machine

<img src="assets/dogear-hero.gif" alt="Dogear demo" width="800" />

